Test WT with of_tf_weight=1.1 and symmetry enabled, including energy, force, and stress.

The nonlocal WT kernel uses the same TF/vW weights as the local contributions.
The reference includes the correction for issue #8243: the single-spin TF energy
must include of_tf_weight, consistently with the potential. The earlier reference
used an unweighted TF energy and consequently an inconsistent cached TF stress.
With the corrected energy, this Al case converges to -57.4900280759 eV and
40.538472 kbar pressure. The stress collector sums absolute tensor components,
so totalstressref is 121.615416 kbar. Forces remain zero by symmetry.
